L["The AFK camera sweeps right round your character, which can bump into walls in tight rooms. Its zoom still runs (within the limit above)."] = "Die AFK-Kamera schwenkt ganz um deinen Charakter herum, was in engen Räumen an Wände stoßen kann. Ihr Zoom läuft trotzdem (innerhalb der Grenze oben)."
L["The Card Vision page's Last time line: what you did last session, as you log in"] = "Die Zeile Letztes Mal der Seite Card Vision: was du in der letzten Sitzung getan hast, beim Einloggen"
